<?xml version="1.0"?>
<ScenContainer xmlns:xsi="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema-instance" xmlns:xsd="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema">
  <ScenTitle>Mediterranean Fury 1, The Road to Byzantium, 1994</ScenTitle>
  <ScenDescription>&lt;BODY scroll=auto&gt;&lt;P style="FONT-SIZE: 14px; TEXT-DECORATION: none; FONT-FAMILY: Verdana,Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif; FONT-VARIANT: normal; WHITE-SPACE: normal; WORD-SPACING: 0px; TEXT-TRANSFORM: none; FONT-WEIGHT: 400; COLOR: rgb(0,0,0); FONT-STYLE: normal; TEXT-ALIGN: left; ORPHANS: 2; LETTER-SPACING: normal; TEXT-INDENT: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px"&gt;&lt;STRONG&gt;Mediterranean Fury 1: The Road to Byzantium.&lt;/STRONG&gt;&lt;/P&gt;&lt;SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 14px; CURSOR: text; TEXT-DECORATION: none; FONT-FAMILY: Verdana,Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif; FONT-VARIANT: normal; WHITE-SPACE: normal; WORD-SPACING: 0px; TEXT-TRANSFORM: none; FLOAT: none; FONT-WEIGHT: 400; COLOR: rgb(0,0,0); FONT-STYLE: normal; TEXT-ALIGN: left; ORPHANS: 2; DISPLAY: inline !important; LETTER-SPACING: normal; BACKGROUND-COLOR: rgb(255,255,255); TEXT-INDENT: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px"&gt;&lt;/SPAN&gt;
&lt;P style="FONT-SIZE: 14px; TEXT-DECORATION: none; FONT-FAMILY: Verdana,Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif; FONT-VARIANT: normal; WHITE-SPACE: normal; WORD-SPACING: 0px; TEXT-TRANSFORM: none; FONT-WEIGHT: 400; COLOR: rgb(0,0,0); FONT-STYLE: normal; TEXT-ALIGN: left; ORPHANS: 2; LETTER-SPACING: normal; TEXT-INDENT: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px"&gt;&lt;STRONG&gt;13 Feb 1994, 1215 Zulu, 1415 Local&lt;/STRONG&gt;&lt;/P&gt;&lt;SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 14px; CURSOR: text; TEXT-DECORATION: none; FONT-FAMILY: Verdana,Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif; FONT-VARIANT: normal; WHITE-SPACE: normal; WORD-SPACING: 0px; TEXT-TRANSFORM: none; FLOAT: none; FONT-WEIGHT: 400; COLOR: rgb(0,0,0); FONT-STYLE: normal; TEXT-ALIGN: left; ORPHANS: 2; DISPLAY: inline !important; LETTER-SPACING: normal; BACKGROUND-COLOR: rgb(255,255,255); TEXT-INDENT: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px"&gt;&lt;/SPAN&gt;
&lt;P style="FONT-SIZE: 14px; TEXT-DECORATION: none; FONT-FAMILY: Verdana,Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif; FONT-VARIANT: normal; WHITE-SPACE: normal; WORD-SPACING: 0px; TEXT-TRANSFORM: none; FONT-WEIGHT: 400; COLOR: rgb(0,0,0); FONT-STYLE: normal; TEXT-ALIGN: left; ORPHANS: 2; LETTER-SPACING: normal; TEXT-INDENT: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px"&gt;The opening day of World War Three; this is a companion to the Northern Fury series and the Northern Fury background document will give you much of the detailed history.&lt;/P&gt;&lt;SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 14px; CURSOR: text; TEXT-DECORATION: none; FONT-FAMILY: Verdana,Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif; FONT-VARIANT: normal; WHITE-SPACE: normal; WORD-SPACING: 0px; TEXT-TRANSFORM: none; FLOAT: none; FONT-WEIGHT: 400; COLOR: rgb(0,0,0); FONT-STYLE: normal; TEXT-ALIGN: left; ORPHANS: 2; DISPLAY: inline !important; LETTER-SPACING: normal; BACKGROUND-COLOR: rgb(255,255,255); TEXT-INDENT: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px"&gt;&lt;/SPAN&gt;
&lt;P style="FONT-SIZE: 14px; TEXT-DECORATION: none; FONT-FAMILY: Verdana,Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif; FONT-VARIANT: normal; WHITE-SPACE: normal; WORD-SPACING: 0px; TEXT-TRANSFORM: none; FONT-WEIGHT: 400; COLOR: rgb(0,0,0); FONT-STYLE: normal; TEXT-ALIGN: left; ORPHANS: 2; LETTER-SPACING: normal; TEXT-INDENT: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px"&gt;You are the Commander of the South Wester Direction HQ in Vinnitsa in Central Ukraine. You report directly to the Soviet High Command in Moscow and you have many responsibilities; however, today in the opening moments of the war you have one focus – Turkey.&lt;/P&gt;&lt;SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 14px; CURSOR: text; TEXT-DECORATION: none; FONT-FAMILY: Verdana,Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif; FONT-VARIANT: normal; WHITE-SPACE: normal; WORD-SPACING: 0px; TEXT-TRANSFORM: none; FLOAT: none; FONT-WEIGHT: 400; COLOR: rgb(0,0,0); FONT-STYLE: normal; TEXT-ALIGN: left; ORPHANS: 2; DISPLAY: inline !important; LETTER-SPACING: normal; BACKGROUND-COLOR: rgb(255,255,255); TEXT-INDENT: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px"&gt;&lt;/SPAN&gt;
&lt;P style="FONT-SIZE: 14px; TEXT-DECORATION: none; FONT-FAMILY: Verdana,Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif; FONT-VARIANT: normal; WHITE-SPACE: normal; WORD-SPACING: 0px; TEXT-TRANSFORM: none; FONT-WEIGHT: 400; COLOR: rgb(0,0,0); FONT-STYLE: normal; TEXT-ALIGN: left; ORPHANS: 2; LETTER-SPACING: normal; TEXT-INDENT: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px"&gt;You’ve been aware of the upcoming campaign for some weeks now, and your key staff for the past month, but your subordinate commanders have only had a week to prepare and the formations involved were only notified in the past days. Division commanders were told yesterday and soldiers were being rounded up even now, minutes before the fighting begins.&lt;/P&gt;&lt;SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 14px; CURSOR: text; TEXT-DECORATION: none; FONT-FAMILY: Verdana,Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif; FONT-VARIANT: normal; WHITE-SPACE: normal; WORD-SPACING: 0px; TEXT-TRANSFORM: none; FLOAT: none; FONT-WEIGHT: 400; COLOR: rgb(0,0,0); FONT-STYLE: normal; TEXT-ALIGN: left; ORPHANS: 2; DISPLAY: inline !important; LETTER-SPACING: normal; BACKGROUND-COLOR: rgb(255,255,255); TEXT-INDENT: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px"&gt;&lt;/SPAN&gt;
&lt;P style="FONT-SIZE: 14px; TEXT-DECORATION: none; FONT-FAMILY: Verdana,Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif; FONT-VARIANT: normal; WHITE-SPACE: normal; WORD-SPACING: 0px; TEXT-TRANSFORM: none; FONT-WEIGHT: 400; COLOR: rgb(0,0,0); FONT-STYLE: normal; TEXT-ALIGN: left; ORPHANS: 2; LETTER-SPACING: normal; TEXT-INDENT: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px"&gt;Your deputy is now at Yalta taking personal charge of the operation, you need to be in Moscow tonight to brief the President. His job, if not his life, depends on seizing the Bosporus in the next 48 hours, then reinforced by mechanized forces from the 32&lt;SUP&gt;nd&lt;/SUP&gt; Army Corps (Crimea Corps), supported by the 24th Air Army and the Black Sea Fleet – the Dardanelles within the week.&lt;/P&gt;&lt;SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 14px; CURSOR: text; TEXT-DECORATION: none; FONT-FAMILY: Verdana,Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif; FONT-VARIANT: normal; WHITE-SPACE: normal; WORD-SPACING: 0px; TEXT-TRANSFORM: none; FLOAT: none; FONT-WEIGHT: 400; COLOR: rgb(0,0,0); FONT-STYLE: normal; TEXT-ALIGN: left; ORPHANS: 2; DISPLAY: inline !important; LETTER-SPACING: normal; BACKGROUND-COLOR: rgb(255,255,255); TEXT-INDENT: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px"&gt;&lt;/SPAN&gt;
&lt;P style="FONT-SIZE: 14px; TEXT-DECORATION: none; FONT-FAMILY: Verdana,Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif; FONT-VARIANT: normal; WHITE-SPACE: normal; WORD-SPACING: 0px; TEXT-TRANSFORM: none; FONT-WEIGHT: 400; COLOR: rgb(0,0,0); FONT-STYLE: normal; TEXT-ALIGN: left; ORPHANS: 2; LETTER-SPACING: normal; TEXT-INDENT: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px"&gt;There are many supporting activities which will be exposed as required, but rest assured – you are not alone in this fight. Even now the wheels are in motion to help you achieve what many have tried and failed in the past.&lt;/P&gt;&lt;SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 14px; CURSOR: text; TEXT-DECORATION: none; FONT-FAMILY: Verdana,Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif; FONT-VARIANT: normal; WHITE-SPACE: normal; WORD-SPACING: 0px; TEXT-TRANSFORM: none; FLOAT: none; FONT-WEIGHT: 400; COLOR: rgb(0,0,0); FONT-STYLE: normal; TEXT-ALIGN: left; ORPHANS: 2; DISPLAY: inline !important; LETTER-SPACING: normal; BACKGROUND-COLOR: rgb(255,255,255); TEXT-INDENT: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px"&gt;&lt;/SPAN&gt;
&lt;P style="FONT-SIZE: 14px; TEXT-DECORATION: none; FONT-FAMILY: Verdana,Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif; FONT-VARIANT: normal; WHITE-SPACE: normal; WORD-SPACING: 0px; TEXT-TRANSFORM: none; FONT-WEIGHT: 400; COLOR: rgb(0,0,0); FONT-STYLE: normal; TEXT-ALIGN: left; ORPHANS: 2; LETTER-SPACING: normal; TEXT-INDENT: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px"&gt;Take your hammer and bang on the door – the Russians are coming!&lt;/P&gt;&lt;SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 14px; CURSOR: text; TEXT-DECORATION: none; FONT-FAMILY: Verdana,Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif; FONT-VARIANT: normal; WHITE-SPACE: normal; WORD-SPACING: 0px; TEXT-TRANSFORM: none; FLOAT: none; FONT-WEIGHT: 400; COLOR: rgb(0,0,0); FONT-STYLE: normal; TEXT-ALIGN: left; ORPHANS: 2; DISPLAY: inline !important; LETTER-SPACING: normal; BACKGROUND-COLOR: rgb(255,255,255); TEXT-INDENT: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px"&gt;&lt;/SPAN&gt;
&lt;P style="FONT-SIZE: 14px; TEXT-DECORATION: none; FONT-FAMILY: Verdana,Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif; FONT-VARIANT: normal; WHITE-SPACE: normal; WORD-SPACING: 0px; TEXT-TRANSFORM: none; FONT-WEIGHT: 400; COLOR: rgb(0,0,0); FONT-STYLE: normal; TEXT-ALIGN: left; ORPHANS: 2; LETTER-SPACING: normal; TEXT-INDENT: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px"&gt;&lt;STRONG&gt;&lt;EM&gt;Catherine the Great’s longest serving consort, Prince Potemkin, after securing control of the &lt;A href="https://erenow.net/biographies/catherinethegreat/67.php"&gt;Crimea&lt;/A&gt; in the 1780’s erected an arch over the highway leading to the Balkans with the inscription: “This is the road to Byzantium,” provocatively reminding the empress of the enduring Russian ambition to control access to the Black Sea and be the successor to the Eastern Roman Empire. Once again Russia is using the Crimea as a springboard to seize the Bosporus and Dardanelles – once more the road is traveled.&lt;/EM&gt;&lt;/STRONG&gt;&lt;/P&gt;&lt;SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 14px; CURSOR: text; TEXT-DECORATION: none; FONT-FAMILY: Verdana,Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif; FONT-VARIANT: normal; WHITE-SPACE: normal; WORD-SPACING: 0px; TEXT-TRANSFORM: none; FLOAT: none; FONT-WEIGHT: 400; COLOR: rgb(0,0,0); FONT-STYLE: normal; TEXT-ALIGN: left; ORPHANS: 2; DISPLAY: inline !important; LETTER-SPACING: normal; BACKGROUND-COLOR: rgb(255,255,255); TEXT-INDENT: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px"&gt;&lt;/SPAN&gt;
&lt;P style="FONT-SIZE: 14px; TEXT-DECORATION: none; FONT-FAMILY: Verdana,Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif; FONT-VARIANT: normal; WHITE-SPACE: normal; WORD-SPACING: 0px; TEXT-TRANSFORM: none; FONT-WEIGHT: 400; COLOR: rgb(0,0,0); FONT-STYLE: normal; TEXT-ALIGN: left; ORPHANS: 2; LETTER-SPACING: normal; TEXT-INDENT: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px"&gt;&lt;STRONG&gt;Designer’s Notes&lt;/STRONG&gt;:&lt;/P&gt;&lt;SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 14px; CURSOR: text; TEXT-DECORATION: none; FONT-FAMILY: Verdana,Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif; FONT-VARIANT: normal; WHITE-SPACE: normal; WORD-SPACING: 0px; TEXT-TRANSFORM: none; FLOAT: none; FONT-WEIGHT: 400; COLOR: rgb(0,0,0); FONT-STYLE: normal; TEXT-ALIGN: left; ORPHANS: 2; DISPLAY: inline !important; LETTER-SPACING: normal; BACKGROUND-COLOR: rgb(255,255,255); TEXT-INDENT: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px"&gt;&lt;/SPAN&gt;
&lt;P style="FONT-SIZE: 14px; TEXT-DECORATION: none; FONT-FAMILY: Verdana,Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif; FONT-VARIANT: normal; WHITE-SPACE: normal; WORD-SPACING: 0px; TEXT-TRANSFORM: none; FONT-WEIGHT: 400; COLOR: rgb(0,0,0); FONT-STYLE: normal; TEXT-ALIGN: left; ORPHANS: 2; LETTER-SPACING: normal; TEXT-INDENT: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px"&gt;This is the 1st scenario of a campaign, probably of about a dozen scenarios total. See the Northern Fury background document for further insight on the background and happenings so far. The key nuggets&lt;/P&gt;&lt;SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 14px; CURSOR: text; TEXT-DECORATION: none; FONT-FAMILY: Verdana,Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif; FONT-VARIANT: normal; WHITE-SPACE: normal; WORD-SPACING: 0px; TEXT-TRANSFORM: none; FLOAT: none; FONT-WEIGHT: 400; COLOR: rgb(0,0,0); FONT-STYLE: normal; TEXT-ALIGN: left; ORPHANS: 2; DISPLAY: inline !important; LETTER-SPACING: normal; BACKGROUND-COLOR: rgb(255,255,255); TEXT-INDENT: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px"&gt;&lt;/SPAN&gt;
&lt;UL style="FONT-SIZE: 14px; TEXT-DECORATION: none; FONT-FAMILY: Verdana,Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif; FONT-VARIANT: normal; WHITE-SPACE: normal; WORD-SPACING: 0px; TEXT-TRANSFORM: none; FONT-WEIGHT: 400; COLOR: rgb(0,0,0); FONT-STYLE: normal; TEXT-ALIGN: left; ORPHANS: 2; LETTER-SPACING: normal; TEXT-INDENT: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px"&gt;
&lt;LI&gt;Cold War continued, no thaw in relations. WP still alive and doing very well.&lt;/LI&gt;
&lt;LI&gt;The 3rd World war starts at 1300hrs Zulu, 13 Feb. The Warsaw Pact forces led by the Soviet Union will attack NATO and other nations on a global scale. The main blow will be in Western Europe but fighting erupted in the Pacific, Caribbean, Middle East and North Africa.&lt;/LI&gt;
&lt;LI&gt;Points are allotted or deducted for losses, achieving special missions and completing objectives.&lt;/LI&gt;
&lt;LI&gt;Some units – especially Bulgarian are not yet ready for war and will take some hours to prepare. Please respect the ready times.&lt;/LI&gt;
&lt;LI&gt;The Spetsnaz forces are not under your control and are not meant to move or attack. Their stealth is their weapon and you will appreciate their information in later parts of the scenario.&lt;/LI&gt;
&lt;LI&gt;Gölcük Naval Base should be near Izmit Turkey but it’s been moved about 38 miles west to account for some issues with ships departing the base and getting hung up.&lt;/LI&gt;
&lt;LI&gt;Ships/subs transiting the restricted waters of the Bosporus straits will travel anywhere within the yellow designated lines, tending towards the outside. Consider this when plotting minefields.&lt;/LI&gt;&lt;/UL&gt;&lt;SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 14px; CURSOR: text; TEXT-DECORATION: none; FONT-FAMILY: Verdana,Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif; FONT-VARIANT: normal; WHITE-SPACE: normal; WORD-SPACING: 0px; TEXT-TRANSFORM: none; FLOAT: none; FONT-WEIGHT: 400; COLOR: rgb(0,0,0); FONT-STYLE: normal; TEXT-ALIGN: left; ORPHANS: 2; DISPLAY: inline !important; LETTER-SPACING: normal; BACKGROUND-COLOR: rgb(255,255,255); TEXT-INDENT: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px"&gt;&lt;/SPAN&gt;
&lt;P style="FONT-SIZE: 14px; TEXT-DECORATION: none; FONT-FAMILY: Verdana,Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif; FONT-VARIANT: normal; WHITE-SPACE: normal; WORD-SPACING: 0px; TEXT-TRANSFORM: none; FONT-WEIGHT: 400; COLOR: rgb(0,0,0); FONT-STYLE: normal; TEXT-ALIGN: left; ORPHANS: 2; LETTER-SPACING: normal; TEXT-INDENT: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px"&gt;Created by Bart Gauvin; AKA Gunner 98&lt;/P&gt;&lt;/BODY&gt;</ScenDescription>
